hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"569","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Makkah mein Najm padhi aur us mein sajda kya. Aur jo Aap key sath they unhon-ne sajda kya, aik budhey key siwa jis ne kankariyon ya mitti ka chullu liya aur use apni peshaani tak uthaaya aur kaha: Mujhey ye kaafi hai. To main ne usey uskey baad kaafir qatl hotey huey dekha. (Bukhari: 1067)"
"570","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: (Suaad) pakkey sajdon mein se nahi hai. Aur beshak main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko us mein sajda kartey huey dekha hai. (Bukhari: 1069)"
"571","[AI-translation] Aur unki (Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ki) hadees ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Najm mein sajda kya qareeb guzar chuki hai Ibn Masood ki riwayat se. Aur is riwayat mein izaafa kya: Aur Aap key sath Musalmanon aur mushrikeen aur jinon aur insaanon ne sajda kya. (Bukhari: 1071)"
"572","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par (Wannajm) padha to Aap ne us mein sajda na kya. (Bukhari: 1073)"
"573","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne (Izas Samaaun Shaqqat) padha aur us mein sajda kya. To un se uskey baarey mein kaha gaya. To unhon-ne kaha: Agar main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko sajda kartey huey na dekhta to sajda na karta. (Bukhari: 1074)"
"574","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ham par surat padhtey they jis mein sajda hota. To Aap sajda kartey aur ham sajda kartey yahan tak ke ham mein se koi apni peshaani ki jagah na paata. (Bukhari: 1079). Namaz qasr karney key abwaab."
